  "body": "Fixes #190. As discussed there, Gecko, WebKit, and Blink all save the\nlast-scrolled-to element as what matches :target.\n\nAlso moves :target's definition to live alongside the rest of the\npseudo-classes, referencing the target element concept from the\nnavigation section.\n## \n\nMajor kudos to @Manishearth for his work in detailing the problem and suggesting a solution in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/190#issuecomment-221873575. I think this implements his suggestion (with @annevk's modification of an explicit pointer). Would appreciate your review, @Manishearth.\n",
